# Test 2b: Quenched spectroscopy - kappa=0.120 (heavy)
# 8^3 x 16 lattice, beta=6.0

-------------------------------
[Lattice]
-------------------------------
nX: 8
nY: 8
nZ: 8
nT: 16

-------------------------------
